    "Message": "<font color=#ff0000><strong>``Accessibility Information:\nAs per the Ministry of Information and Broadcasting (MIB) advisory, accessibility features such as Audio Description (AD), Closed Captions (CC), Same Language Captioning (SLC), and Indian Sign Language (ISL) may not be available for all movies or shows. Where these features are available, they will be indicated on the movie synopsis page.``</strong></font><br><strong><font color=``ff0000``>1. Pre-booked Food & Beverages have to be collected by the patrons from the F&B counter by showing a valid booking ID.</font><br>\n2. For 3D movies, 3D glasses charges will be charged extra.<br>\n3. No entry for those under 18 years for ``A`` rated movies.\n<strong><font color=``ff0000``>Below points are for Large Screen</font><br>\n1. 3D Glasses Provided To You Are Unique, Expensive And Sanitized For Your Safety. <br> \n2. These Glasses Are Specially Made For 3D Viewing Only On Our Big Screen, Not Suitable For Other Screens <br>\n 3. Please Handle Glasses With Care, In Case Of Loss/Damage Cost Of Rs.2000/- Will Be Charged <br>\n 4. Please Return The Glasses To Our Staff Before Exiting The Auditorium <br>\n 5. Please Don`t Leave The 3D Glasses At The Seats <br>\n 6. 3D Glasses Are Chargeable Over And Above The Ticket Price <br>\n 7. For One Ticket, One 3D Glasses Will Be Distributed.<br>\n 8. Children above the age of 3 years and above require tickets.",
